f=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02636-9\" data-track=\"click\" data-track-label=\"latest magazine (tag:2) (rank:2)\">\n                            \n                                <img src=\"https://images.nature.com/w140h79/magazine-assets/d41586-026-02636-9/d41586-026-02636-9_53167106.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                            \n                            <p>India has an ambitious plan to lure scientists back — will it work?</p>\n                            <p><span>News</span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-09-01\">01 SEP 26</time></span></p>\n                        </a>\n                    </li>","sentences":[{"en":"India has an ambitious plan to lure scientists back — will it work?","zh":null},{"en":"News 01 SEP 26","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>India has an ambitious plan to lure scientists back — will it work?</p>","sentences":[{"en":"India has an ambitious plan to lure scientists back — will it work?","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>News</span> <span><time datetime=\"2026-09-01\">01 SEP 26</time></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"News 01 SEP 26","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"content\" data-container-type=\"article\" data-component=\"article-container\">\n            \n\n            \n\n            <article data-track-component=\"news\" lang=\"en\">\n                \n                <div>\n                    \n                        <div>\n    <header>\n        <div>\n            <ul data-test=\"article-identifier\">\n                \n                    <li data-test=\"article-category\">一致</li>\n                    <li>01 September 2026</li>\n                \n                \n            </ul>\n\n            \n\n            \n        </div>\n        \n            <div>\n                \n                    <p><span>By</span></p><ul data-test=\"authors-list\" data-component-authors-activator=\"authors-list\">\n    \n        \n        <li>Chiranjib Chakraborty0</li>\n    \n</ul>\n\n\n<div data-test=\"author-info\">\n    <ol>\n        \n            <li>Chiranjib Chakraborty Adamas University, Kolkata, India.</li>\n        \n    </ol>\n</div>\n\n                \n            </div>\n        \n    </header>\n\n    \n    \n    \n        \n            \n    \n\n        \n    \n</div>\n                    \n\n                    \n\n                    \n                        \n                        <p>Chris Lu and his colleagues describe an AI scientist that can generate hypotheses, conduct computational experiments, interpret results, write papers, and review its own work (C. Lu et al. Nature 651, 914–919; 2026). As artificial-intelligence systems become more independent, responsibility for scientific outcomes could be divided up between users, institutions and developers.</p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                        <p>Nature 657, 312 (2026)</p>\n                        <p>doi: https://doi.org/10.1038/d41586-026-02735-7</p>\n\n                    \n                    <div id=\"competing-interests\" data-toggle=\"anchor-links-section\" data-label=\"Competing Interests\">\n                            <h2>利益竞争</h2>\n                            <p>作者声明不存在竞争利益。</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                    \n                        <h2 id=\"related-articles\">相关文章</h2>\n                        <ul>\n    \n        <li>Why AI cannot do good science without humans</li>\n    \n        <li>Will AI spark a scientific renaissance — or a diffuse monoculture?</li>\n    \n        <li>科学界不加批判地采用人工智能令人震惊——我们迫切需要护栏</li>\n    \n        <li>查看更多给编辑的信</li>\n    \n</ul>\n                    \n\n                    \n                        <h2 id=\"subjects\">科目</h2>\n                        \n                    <section data-component-tab-list=\"true\" data-track=\"in-view\" data-track-action=\"in-view\" data-track-category=\"latest content\" data-track